  m_text: 'The security of your account will be enhanced with the Gold Protection
    Function.

    If Gold Protection is enabled, you will have to enter a password 
    when you wish to transfer Gold or join a table.

    We strongly recommend that
    you enable Gold Protection  and remember your password.

    Please note that
    your Gold Protection password should be different from your login password.

